{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Issue 1858: Eye of the Beholder raises spell crit and Glyphic Ruin and Primordial Blast damage by 25%",
  "contract": [
    "Eye of the Beholder 500121 (Runemaster Glyphic talent, CharacterAdvancement 29167, family 38) reads 'Increases",
    "your spell critical strike chance by $s2% for $d. While active, the damage of your Glyphic Ruin and Primordial",
    "Blast is increased by $s1%.' Spell.dbc: instant self cast, duration index 8 (15 sec), 3 min cooldown; effect 0",
    "SPELL_AURA_ADD_PCT_MODIFIER (108) SPELLMOD_DAMAGE BasePoints 24 on mask0 0x401000, which is Glyphic Ruin 801179",
    "(mask0 0x1000) and Primordial Blast 800732 (mask0 0x400000) but not Elemental Burst 802202 (mask2 0x20000);",
    "effect 1 SPELL_AURA_MOD_SPELL_CRIT_CHANCE_SCHOOL (71) MiscValue 126 (Holy..Arcane) BasePoints 24. Both are",
    "native auras, so no script is needed; the audit only found no source reference to the id. Expected: the cast",
    "applies a 15 sec aura and a 3 min cooldown, Arcane, Fire and Frost spell crit rise by 25 points, the damage",
    "modifier of Glyphic Ruin and Primordial Blast goes from 100 to 125 and their native damage from 1000 rises by",
    "25%, Elemental Burst is unchanged, and everything returns when the aura expires."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "location": {"map": 0, "x": -8949.95, "y": -132.493, "z": 83.5312, "o": 0},
  "players": [
    {"id": "rm", "race": 1, "class": 32, "level": 80, "spell_hit_rating": 10000}
  ],
  "creatures": [
    {"id": "dummy", "owner": "rm", "entry": 36, "level": 80, "health": 1000000, "distance": 3}
  ],
  "steps": [
